  fst (ranges_apartM bc kd sp br1 xm b1 k1 n1 b2 k2 n2) = ranges_apartBF2 bc kd sp br1 b1 k1 n1 b2 k2 n2
  /\ XMOK bc (snd (ranges_apartM bc kd sp br1 xm b1 k1 n1 b2 k2 n2)).
Proof.
